  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On the battle stage in Shang clan city, Bai Ning Bing’s follow-up kick only shatters the flagstone after Wei Yang has already pulled clear. Little Xiao names the Gu as Wei Yang’s rainbow light Gu in that beat, and the light reforms more than fifty meters away across the stage from Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing.",
        "chapters": [
          266
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_wei_yang",
          "char_xiao_yan",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later teaching in Shang clan city names Wei Yang a movement type Gu Master whose core Gu worm is rainbow light Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "owner",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As the core of that set, rainbow light Gu is paired with broadsword light Gu and light source Gu as supports.",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "owner",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_broadsword_light_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later asks why rainbow light Gu and position swap Gu require Gu Masters free of strength modifications, and answers that the law of strength interferes with the law of light and the law of space, so strong strength Dao marks can make those Gu fail when used.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "strength-path-conflict",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_position_swap_gu",
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      }
    ]
